  "2026-10-15T00:40:10.201Z",codex-agent,"Final Linux acceptance: just release-check passed at unchanged pins and thresholds in an isolated Git identity environment. Both the ordinary and fresh branch-instrumented suites passed 317 tests across 17 targets, with zero failures or ignored tests. Coverage: 5646/5646 lines, 8630/8630 regions, 522/522 functions and 1194/1194 branches, all 100 percent. Formatting, deny-warnings Clippy, private-item rustdoc, identity audit, locked-oracle differential suites, cargo audit and changelog check passed. Cargo audit retains the inherited allowed RUSTSEC-2024-0449 unmaintained advisory. Per-item behavioral revert proof and linked-test receipts remain recorded separately. Releasing ownership for orchestrator verification; this item remains in progress and is not closed."
